  "snp3.12:37.4": "“There are these four nutriments for the maintenance of beings who have come into being or for the support of those in search of a place to be born. Which four? Physical food, gross or refined; contact as the second, intellectual intention the third, and consciousness the fourth.” — <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn12.63'>SN 12:63</a>. For more on this topic, see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn12.63'>SN 12:63–64</a>.",
