  "snp3.12:53.1": "“His release, being founded on truth, does not fluctuate, for whatever is deceptive is false; unbinding—the undeceptive—is true. Thus a monk so endowed is endowed with the highest determination for truth, for this—unbinding, the undeceptive—is the highest noble truth.” — <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn140'>MN 140</a>",
